      "writtenOn": "2018-01-15T00:00:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is minSdkVersion and maxSdkVersion used for? I can\u0027t seem to find where they are modified from their default values.",
      "revId": "be3b87f143fe6382aa8f63fb04f274d9af2e706e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
